  * Raise CMake minimum to 3.5
- Rename lib subpackages with the versioned soname:
  libcmark-gfm0_29_0_gfm_14 and
  libcmark-gfm-extensions0_29_0_gfm_14
- Rebase cmark-gfm-0.29.0.gfm.13-cmake4.patch: drop cmake-minimum
  hunk adopted upstream, keep FindPython test switch
- Fix %check 2/13 failures (extensions Example 25): copy raw
  footnote label bytes into owned storage via
  cmark-gfm-footnote-label.patch (upstream #403 fixed the UAF but
  truncated labels at HTML inlines)

