Sat Jun 27 00:00:00 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <mpluskal@suse.com>

- Initial package (version 0.29.0.gfm.13)
- Add cmark-gfm-0.29.0.gfm.13-cmake4.patch to build with CMake 4 and
